{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a9c1600e88eef61f686015fca55c569e15a1693b5b3a609f853125345cdd5754", "ja": "オールスターライブを終えたアイドル達が\nまた新たなステージへと向かっていく中、\n自分だけの思い出の場所で、どんなアイドル\nになりたいかを語る春香との一幕です。", "zh": "这是与春香在只属于自己的回忆之地畅谈理想偶像模样的一幕。全明星演唱会结束后，偶像们正迈向全新的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9048e21b4a040fdd9d5a0122974a5bdcbac7001b47ef9f7f5e2fba626d154f1c", "ja": "（Destiny公演を終えて、アイドル達は再び\n新しい世界に向かって飛び出していく）", "zh": "（结束Destiny公演后，偶像们再次朝着全新的世界展翅而去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1001_p", "source_sha256": "660f0063c6e81efda5156905b73a39a5676de1023c09fa80d3de29e2d621ba62", "ja": "（そんな中、春香に雑誌の取材が入った。\n記事のテーマは……『憧れの原点』だ）", "zh": "（与此同时，春香接到了杂志采访。文章的主题是……“憧憬的起点”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "0d52e8cdac0a558df6e3f6c405e0a79231d600e6c1c3ea3e24c5d72ebf3a9463", "ja": "う～んっ、いいお天気！\nえへへ、絶好の撮影日和ですね♪", "zh": "嗯～天气真好！\n嘿嘿，真是最适合拍摄的好天气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ed7f6457453b3c0cf9cdcb140ae316fc28fa8fbafda3a2a2aaf39512f0ff0e26", "ja": "春香、ずいぶんご機嫌だな。\nやっぱり地元での撮影だからか？", "zh": "春香，你今天心情真好啊。\n果然是因为在家乡拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "a48c83c4c1b72ec8913b015a84949c37b6b06661d3a4dde4eed5c579ada72f95", "ja": "はいっ。しかもここ、私のお気に入りの\n公園なんですよ♪　だから嬉しくて！", "zh": "没错！而且这里还是我最喜欢的公园♪所以特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "64361c73727619d6a74ed08d4ca96843bc137927ffeb65960800e7c6e7d81cab", "ja": "アイドルになってからはあんまり来れなかったから、\nなんだか懐かしいです。よく遊んでたんですよね～。", "zh": "成为偶像之后就没怎么来过了，感觉好怀念啊。我以前经常在这里玩呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "c547a7cd817dea70ff8a165170ade3c05afbf8a0b7206f8c261b80102a31e506", "ja": "たまにおばあちゃんが出て来てくれた時も、わざわざ\nここまで来て、お手玉とか教えてもらってました♪", "zh": "有时候奶奶过来的时候，也会特意来到这里，教我丢沙包之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1007_p", "source_sha256": "38578603ad853b14835376fc64b171390981eabd6c7c630a0deff24738c4264a", "ja": "へえ。それじゃここには、\n春香のいろんな思い出が詰まってるんだな。", "zh": "哦～，这么说来，这里装满了春香的各种回忆啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "ef7eaef30c9b3ec87899c95870725164dd50d73ae3c126f32ac0ca1a73584d0d", "ja": "えへへ、そうですね♪　……あ、そうだ！\nもう一つ、とっても大事な思い出がありました！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊♪……啊，对了！\n我还想起了另一段非常重要的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8f1f4a75b4b0a9a298ebe1784c9dd3e8043016d245a94bb08613b23bf9afc80e", "ja": "お、そうなのか？", "zh": "哦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "b17af65f167d7f208c86b33a8ac5ddbcdc3772f4da5f5ac63246062ea4cfafb3", "ja": "はい！　小さい頃、この公園に来ると、いつも\n楽しそうに歌ってる『歌のお姉さん』がいたんです。", "zh": "是的！小时候来到这个公园时，总能看到一位开心唱歌的“唱歌姐姐”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1630404c2ca549653feb6f3b6e46087084460fd65b09c3abdd4385eed5b7c8e5", "ja": "歌のお姉さん？", "zh": "唱歌的大姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "244b87a0429798e1030b35eabc9b7c140ebbed58bfbf59cc58f1c21250645f84", "ja": "はい！　とっても歌が上手で、優しくて、\nいろんなことを教えてくれて……。", "zh": "是的！她唱歌特别好听，又很温柔，还教会了我好多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "7f8298bb91a941ce60944baccd4a42df75bdee275ed4912774f332f29b0576ea", "ja": "歌も、最初は聞いてるだけだったんですけど、\nいつの間にか一緒に歌わせてもらうようになって……。", "zh": "唱歌也是，起初我只是听着，后来不知不觉就和她一起唱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "37f4b2f59e50f2abf52cb90be3ab96f671446c516aa22468f3fb209151f91158", "ja": "そんな思い出の場所だったりもします♪\nえへへ、毎日楽しかったなあ……。", "zh": "那里也是充满回忆的地方♪\n嘿嘿，每天都过得很开心呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6b7e8508156ac7a8dbd90af911d79829c1164bb9152ac9dc43ab81263698f81b", "ja": "じゃあ……春香が歌を好きになったのも、\nもしかして、そのお姉さんがキッカケで？", "zh": "那么……春香喜欢上唱歌，也是因为那位姐姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "5e44fd4ce1ce7f63eaf4a0eb50517ad179357ac5d014284a3aac861067d1ee23", "ja": "そうですね。楽しそうに歌うお姉さんと一緒にいると、\n私もすごく楽しくて、幸せな気持ちになれました。", "zh": "是啊。和那位开心地唱着歌的大姐姐待在一起时，我也觉得特别快乐，心里充满了幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "b8208f70cbaf38803c75fda2203849a3bffa85ff105550bfeabdf265db30fd80", "ja": "だから今でも私の憧れで……目標なんです。\n私も『歌のお姉さん』みたいに……。", "zh": "所以直到现在，她依然是我憧憬的对象……也是我的目标。\n我也想像“唱歌的大姐姐”那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "a166041238f846f21b0fc6e443fea811fe88f4612d78ab2951fa72a21a2692a7", "ja": "歌を歌うことで、周りの人をとっても楽しくて、\n幸せな気持ちにできたらいいなって！", "zh": "要是能通过唱歌，让身边的人感到特别开心、特别幸福就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a82b6a05e3303093ac3ac50f4cf7f76b8c7bfbdab575c5f51bb7a2052d0b0b3c", "ja": "憧れで、目標か……。でも、それなら、\n春香は目標を達成できてるんじゃないか？", "zh": "憧憬和目标啊……不过，如果是这样的话，\n春香不是已经实现目标了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "a08a5501ac8427aff692b1ed62b5c8b052f0072cbecaeeb1890c526bce1467ef", "ja": "え？　……えええっ、そうですか？", "zh": "咦？……诶诶诶，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1021_p", "source_sha256": "94e4b5ff8586fdd5a3eb80ff511d138b1a928510d7c06df9ff48d1ff93d7a530", "ja": "今の春香は憧れられる立場だからな。実際、春香に\n憧れてアイドルを目指した子も出てきてる。", "zh": "现在的春香已经是令人憧憬的对象了。实际上，也有孩子因为憧憬春香而立志成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1681e31f3f2212822304b47bdeacea915cdea6532fbbf23ef930e44d7bbe077e", "ja": "今の春香はもう、誰かにとっての\n『歌のお姉さん』になれてると思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得现在的春香，已经成为某个人心中的“唱歌姐姐”了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "0cb04ebd3bce9bbd5e644c4d78d1467d5bdbc130519cb51bf3f5adf9d9b07b04", "ja": "私が……誰かの、お姉さんに……。", "zh": "我……成为了某个人的……大姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "89e3179be17af23725c66f9c1a50ca1995c123de95c2af8ba486fd14a5325b19", "ja": "……。あの、{$P$}さん。\nもしかしたら、そうなのかもですけど……。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生。\n或许……真的是那样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "1a842cabc7da1aff8621daea7ea1bb45f7722c4b735e14f8caa41360ee1ddf12", "ja": "だとしたら、とっても嬉しいですけど……。\nただ、あんまり実感もなくて……。だから！", "zh": "如果真是那样，我会非常开心的……  \n只是，还是没什么实感……所以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "498931e86c6ddf65f11434a911adac2d0b63c1ec0ab81d0ab997473d51cd1275", "ja": "もっともっと、みんなの『歌のお姉さん』になりたい\nです！　……っていうのは、あの、わがままですか？", "zh": "我想更加、更加成为大家的“唱歌姐姐”\n！……那个，这算是我的任性要求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1027_p", "source_sha256": "9986ff084f02a89453cedfd2b518f91ed200ec0dd1e8407e8e938248db965c0b", "ja": "とんでもない。春香の歌は、たまたま公園に来た\n近所の小さな女の子だけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "当然不是。春香的歌，不只是要传给碰巧来到公园的附近小女孩，还要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6051582d531e8d65ac0cd4b83e9176e1045555a5999ad29d89a2342c3d6be287", "ja": "会場いっぱいのお客さん達、全国のお客さん達に\n届けないとな！　だから、まだまだこれからだ！", "zh": "得让会场里满满的观众、以及全国各地的观众都听到才行！所以，接下来还要继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "ce1ceeea3efe05b13ce22d05bd79440484ddd49dd789473304666f0782f105d4", "ja": "……はいっ♪　そうですよね。もっともっと、\nたくさんの人に、私の……。ううん。", "zh": "……好的♪　说得也是呢。好想让更多、\n更多的人听到我的……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "afe86eb79968566157a63803a902ba3a0180ece4b4e0ea17e7d5e80b9bd02533", "ja": "私たちの歌を届けたいです！　劇場のみんなと、\nそれから、{$P$}さんと……。", "zh": "我想把我们的歌声传递给更多的人！和剧场的大家，还有{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "1b9622283bcd39218f7e1c11fb52c8151983e3c11e6aa9d06c0a3fa6d106a39f", "ja": "みんなで一緒に！　……えへへ♪", "zh": "大家一起！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c6d6c219d96d23f3344b6fdd2c327040c3483455fac30cece5d7ebdf484b6e7c", "ja": "（……アイドル達は皆、自分だけの音を奏でている。\nそれぞれの色で、それぞれの音符となって）", "zh": "（……每一位偶像都在演奏只属于自己的声音。\n用各自的色彩，化作各自的音符）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_206_gc_01_sub_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_206_gc_01_sub_1033_p", "source_sha256": "92873a77fcc9c3f5e96a2746a01324abd415f5d94e7e829bdec42b96d08a4c0d", "ja": "（ただ、春香の音符はいつも、\nたくさんの音符に囲まれているのだろう）", "zh": "（只是，春香的音符，总是被许许多多的音符包围着吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
